Description: Catholic background of the day for KDE Plasma
 Provider for the Picture of the Day wallpaper of KDE Plasma 6 that
 downloads the daily wallpaper from a Catholic background of the day
 server.
 .
 It also includes Catholic Background Settings, an application to choose
 the server, refresh the wallpaper and use it on every desktop.
